B = [
    ('Rolls-Royce', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Rolls-Royce, monumental, upright and hushed grandeur. Tall formal verticals, long smooth rolling volumes and flat slab surfaces, with a single thin bright line drawn along the length of a form. Mirror-polished metal with slim fluted vertical rhythm, and deep lustrous colour in claret, silver sand, midnight blue or black, often in two tones with a lower band of silver. Hand-stitched cream or tan leather, deep wool pile, burr walnut veneer with fine inlay and weighty turned metal details. Dignified, imposing, effortless and quiet.'),
    ('Bentley', 'Europe', '1920s-30s and 1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Bentley, muscular, wide and heavy grandeur with a gentleman sporting edge. Powerful swelling curves, a long forward mass, a deep sculpted shoulder and a low planted stance. Early work is open, riveted and raw in dark racing green with leather straps and visible fixings, later work is polished chrome, diamond-quilted leather in contrasting hides, knurled metal details and open-pore burr wood. Deep green, dark blue, silver, black and burgundy. Powerful, hand-finished and substantial.'),
    ('Jaguar', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Jaguar, long, low, sensuous and feline. Very long sweeping lines, a tight compact core set far back and flowing curved surfaces that taper to a slim point. Smoothly faired forms, fine bright metal detail and a single leaping animal motif used sparingly as a mark. British racing green, signal red, cream, metallic silver-blue and opalescent grey. Red or tan leather and polished wood. Elegant speed, curvaceous and graceful.'),
    ('Aston Martin', 'Europe', '1960s and 2000s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Aston Martin, lean, refined and quietly aggressive elegance. A long stretched mass with a short compact rear, a wide trapezoid opening of fine horizontal slats in a bright surround, a low rakish line falling to a clipped end and a muscular flowing curve under a crisp rising shoulder. Silver birch, racing green, midnight blue and gunmetal. Hand-stitched quilted leather, contrast piping, polished glass details, fine wood or carbon weave. Sleek, taut, understated and elegant.'),
    ('Mini', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Mini, tiny, boxy, cheeky and playful. A compact two-box volume with everything pushed to the corners, very short overhangs, flat upright ends and a small flat top. Round chrome details, thin bright frames, visible welded seams, exposed joints and slim edges. Bright colour in tartan red, island blue, white and racing green with a contrasting white top and long bold stripes. Bare minimal surfaces and rubber texture. Compact, friendly, honest and fun.'),
    ('Land Rover', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Land Rover, rugged, honest and farmyard-tough utility. Flat slab aluminium panels, upright bluff faces and squared corners. Canvas coverings and strapped-on equipment worn openly. Matt olive green, bronze green, sand, poppy red and pale grey with white accents. Spartan painted metal, bare rubber, simple round faces and tough fabric. Utilitarian, hard-working and unpretentious. Rivets, bolts and seams are left visible, finishes are matt and wear is expected.'),
    ('Lotus', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lotus, extremely low, light, stripped and track-bred. A thin moulded skin, a sharp wedge or rounded teardrop profile, a very low overall height, wide swelling curves and bare minimal edges tapering to a high end. Racing green with a bright yellow stripe, bright yellow, white, orange and metallic silver. Basic cramped spaces with thin moulded forms and exposed aluminium. Minimal, purposeful, nimble and lightweight.'),
    ('Morgan', 'Europe', '1930s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Morgan, hand-built, charming and deliberately pre-war. Long louvred volumes, separate sweeping curves that stand apart from the main mass, a narrow flat middle, a rounded end and a tall upright chrome face with a slim vertical bar. Aluminium over ash wood, folding canvas and leather straps. Racing green, claret, cream, navy and ivory with polished brass and chrome. Leather, polished wood and round white faces. Handcrafted, nostalgic and cheerful.'),
    ('Austin', 'Europe', '1930s-50s', 'cars', 'In the style of Austin, rounded, upright, sensible and homely family comfort. Tall chrome uprights, curved separate forms, large round shapes set on the surface, louvred sides, rounded volumes and narrow bright edges. Black, maroon, deep green, grey and cream, often two-tone. Beige or maroon leather. Stately, modest, dependable and comfortable. Thin steel with chrome caps, thick carpet, polished wood and softly padded comfort throughout.'),
    ('Triumph', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Triumph, breezy, sporty and affordable open-air fun. A long low mass, a tidy tapering end, chrome edges, rounded sculpted surfaces with one crisp crease and a folding black cloth top. Signal red, white, British racing green, pale yellow and deep blue. Black or red vinyl moulded forms, wood or painted panels. Jaunty, compact and cheerful, with unfussy honest detailing.'),
    ('MG', 'Europe', '1930s and 1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of MG, small, jaunty open sporting spirit. A tall upright chrome front of vertical slats under an octagon motif, a long flat louvred top, cutaway sides, separate sweeping curves and a rounded end. Racing green, red, cream, ivory and pale blue. Red or black leather, engine-turned or wooden panels. Spirited, cheerful, plucky and simple. Wire-spoke patterns and chrome-rimmed round faces add period charm.'),
    ('Volkswagen', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Volkswagen, cute, honest, friendly and economical. One smooth continuous curve with a domed top, rounded ends and bug-eye round forms standing up from the surface. Pastel beige, sea blue, coral red, mint green, ivory and cream. Bare painted metal, plain cloth or vinyl and exposed painted panels. Simple, rounded, practical and charming. Slim chrome edges and tiny oval openings keep ornament to a minimum.'),
    ('Porsche', 'Europe', '1960s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Porsche, compact, balanced, purposeful and athletic. A smooth teardrop profile with one sloping line falling from front to back, round forms rising from flared surfaces, wide muscular curves and short overhangs. Thin full-width bands of light in modern work. Guards red, silver grey, signal orange, racing yellow, pale blue and black. A tiny crest used as a mark. Black leather, houndstooth cloth and aluminium trim.'),
    ('BMW', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of BMW, precise, focused and understated sporty design. A crisp three-box shape, thin supports, generous glazing, a low nose with two slim vertical oval openings framed by chrome bars and one sharp shoulder line running end to end. A slight forward-leaning shark stance. Cross-spoke patterns and a blue and white roundel mark. Silver, bright blue, henna red, black, white and fjord grey. Black cloth or leather, clear round faces and plain brushed trim.'),
    ('Mercedes-Benz', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Mercedes-Benz, upright, dignified, solid and formal engineering. Tall bright verticals crowned by a three-pointed star mark, wide bright surrounds, flat sides with sharp creases, thin supports beneath generous glazing and chunky edges with rubber strips. Champagne, ivory, signal red, midnight blue, silver grey and black. Wide tufted velour or leather, walnut trim and large rotary details. Substantial, formal, safe and meticulous.'),
    ('Audi', 'Europe', '1980s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Audi, clean, precise, taut and technical. A large single-frame hexagonal shape with horizontal bars in a bright or black surround, four interlocking rings as a mark, sharp tight surfaces, a taut shoulder line, flush glazing and crisp light signatures made of thin lines. Glacier white, grey, black, tango red and navy. A flat machined look, aluminium trim, perfect gaps between panels, black or grey leather and digital displays. Crisp, engineered and understated.'),
    ('Opel', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Opel, neat, compact, sporty and stylish mass-market design. A wide low stance, a rectangular black-mesh panel with a lightning bolt mark, a waist that swells and rises toward the end, small chrome edges, thin supports and a gently curved sloping line with flared arches. Signal yellow, bright orange, lime green, white and sky blue. Checked cloth or vinyl and simple round faces. Tidy, youthful and sporty.'),
    ('Citroen', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Citroen, futuristic, quirky, avant-garde and comfortable. A low streamlined teardrop body that seems to crouch, a narrowly tapering end, smooth skirts covering the lower edges, minimal slot openings and a double chevron mark. Pale green, ivory, grey blue and sand beige, or bold orange and brown, with white accents. Very low interiors with checked cloth, pod-shaped instruments and odd plastic details.'),
    ('Peugeot', 'Europe', '1980s-2000s', 'cars', 'In the style of Peugeot, neat, compact, well-proportioned and sporty. A clean wedge profile, a small rampant lion mark, a rectangular black panel between slim wraparound shapes, smooth uncluttered flanks with one crisp line, black plastic edges and a rising beltline. White, bright red, ocean blue, silver, dark green and black. Deep-pile cloth, grey plastic and thin stalks keep interiors clear. Tidy, practical and lively.'),
    ('Renault', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Renault, cheerful, functional, boxy and practical. A square profile, flat surfaces, huge flat rectangular shapes, a large diamond mark centred on a flat black field, flat side panels with plastic rub strips and fat black edges. Bright orange, yellow, vivid red, light blue, off-white and beige metallic. Bold striped or checked cloth and flat black or brown panels. Compact, sunny and unfussy.'),
    ('Bugatti', 'Europe', '1930s', 'cars', 'In the style of Bugatti, sensuous, artistic, elegant and aristocratic coachbuilt sculpture. A tall horseshoe-shaped nickel-polished front with a small red oval mark, fine louvres, flowing swept curves, a boat-tail or teardrop end and steeply raked glazing. French racing blue, black over red, deep cream and two-tone schemes with a polished metal spine. Soft red or brown leather, engine-turned aluminium and small round faces.'),
    ('Delahaye', 'Europe', '1930s', 'cars', 'In the style of Delahaye, flamboyant, theatrical, curvaceous Art Deco coachwork. Very long sweeping lines, a teardrop body, pontoon forms flowing over the base, a long mass running into a sloping end, fine chrome bars and chrome spears running through the curves. Two-tone schemes such as ivory over dark blue, silver over burgundy and deep black. Cream or red leather and engine-turned metal with round faces.'),
    ('Alfa Romeo', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Alfa Romeo, passionate, lively and graceful Italian sporting design. A low slim body with a distinctive triangular shield shape flanked by mesh, a circular emblem with a red cross and crowned serpent, rounded forms under glass, a long mass and pointed tapering end. Chrome edges. Alfa red, white, light blue, silver and dark green. Bucket forms, wood and drilled aluminium and deep-set round faces add a racing note.'),
    ('Ferrari', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Ferrari, sensual, dramatic and fast. A low wide body with a long curved or wedge-shaped front, round or pop-up light shapes, egg-crate mesh, curvy swelling forms and a sloping line with flying buttresses or side strakes. A prancing black horse on a yellow shield used as a mark. Rosso red, giallo yellow, silver, black and dark blue. Tan or black leather and exposed metal gate details.'),
    ('Lamborghini', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lamborghini, brash, theatrical and futuristic. Razor-sharp creases and a body barely waist-high. Louvres, panels that rise up like wings, flat black louvred surfaces and wide hips. A golden bull on a black shield used as a mark. Vivid lime green, orange, yellow, white, red and purple. Extreme, dramatic and showy. Interiors are angular black leather with wedge-shaped panels, pod dials and small switches.'),
    ('Maserati', 'Europe', '1960s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Maserati, graceful, smooth, refined and elegant Italian grand touring. A long mass, a tight sloping line, a large oval shape with vertical chrome bars bearing a trident mark, boomerang-shaped forms and wide sculpted curves. Deep blue, silver, dark burgundy, pearl white and black. Tan, red or cream leather with fine stitching. Polished wood or carbon trim and a single analogue clock at the centre of the panel add refinement.'),
    ('Lancia', 'Europe', '1950s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lancia, refined, finely detailed, understated and intellectual with a gentle sporty edge. A narrow shield-shaped chrome front, a small flag mark bearing a lance, tidy proportions, delicate supports, generous glazing, thin chrome trim along the flanks and a slightly tapered end. Rally work has boxy flared arches, white or grey accents and wide blue and red stripes. Pale grey, midnight blue, cream, ivory and rich burgundy. Wool or velour and wood veneer.'),
    ('Fiat', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Fiat, tiny, round, cheerful and playful post-war Italian city design. A bulbous egg-shaped body, tiny bug-like round forms, a flat or lightly curved top sometimes rolled open as canvas and thin chrome edges. Pastel yellow, powder blue, light green, cream, cherry red and white. Bare metal surfaces painted in the body colour, a single round face and simple vinyl or fabric.'),
    ('Volvo', 'Europe', '1960s-90s', 'cars', 'In the style of Volvo, boxy, upright, sturdy, safe and rational Swedish design. A flat top surface, a large diagonal strip bearing a circle with arrow mark, square shapes, upright supports, a flat-sided body with a thin crease, black edges with rubber trim and a long flat roofline. Beige, forest green, mustard, silver, white and dark blue. Thick supportive plaid cloth or leather and flat panels with large clear faces.'),
    ('Saab', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Saab, aeronautical, quirky, practical and eccentric Swedish design. A short stubby nose sloping down, deeply curved glazing, a rounded cockpit-like core and rectangular forms. A small gryphon head on a red circle as a mark, black plastic edges and one distinctive curved support. Alloy discs with a distinct hole pattern. Black, silver metallic, deep red, white and dark blue. Deep moulded forms in grey or blue cloth and an asymmetrical wraparound panel with big round faces.'),
    ('Tatra', 'Europe', '1930s-40s', 'cars', 'In the style of Tatra, streamlined, futuristic, odd and aerodynamic. A long smooth teardrop body, a central spine-like fin running along the back, a tapering end with rows of cooling louvres, smooth flush sides and curved skirted forms. Disc patterns with chrome caps and bright trim used sparingly. Dark green, black, metallic grey and burgundy. Wide soft cloth or leather and warm wooden panelling with simple round faces. Eccentric, engineered and slightly strange.'),
    ('Skoda', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Skoda, small, plain, boxy, honest and rugged Czech design. A flat top surface, round forms, a simple small opening, chrome-rimmed edges, a smooth unfussy body and a slim roofline. A winged arrow mark. Pale beige, olive green, sky blue, mustard yellow and brick red. Plain vinyl and flat plastic panels in grey or brown. Modest, utilitarian and unpretentious.'),
    ('Trabant', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Trabant, tiny, boxy, austere, humble and slightly smoky East German design. A flat top surface, pressed plastic panels, flat sides, square corners with slight rounding, round forms and small chrome edges. Pastel pale blue, beige, sage green, orange and white with a faded matt finish. A bare flat interior and plain hard vinyl. Pressed plastic panels and a thin faded look give honest austerity.'),
    ('Seat', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Seat, compact, square-cut, sunny, simple and affordable Spanish design. A flat top surface, a plain rectangular panel, square forms, black plastic edges, crisp straight lines, a flat roof, boxy glazing and flat sides. A small stylised S mark and tidy rectangular forms. Bright red, yellow, white, silver and dark blue. Striped cloth and flat panels with simple round faces.'),
    ('Alpine', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Alpine, tiny, rounded, low, nimble, light and rallying French sportiness. A moulded body with a swooping curved roofline, smooth rounded forms, a small oval air opening, very low glazing and a sloping end. Small wide steel or alloy shapes with chrome nuts. Bright blue, orange, white and yellow, often with stripes along the top. Cloth and vinyl moulded forms and simple panels with round faces. Playful, compact and fast.'),
    ('Koenigsegg', 'Europe', '2000s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Koenigsegg, hyper-sleek, exotic, clean and ultra-technical Swedish engineering. A low wide body, narrow slit shapes, panels that swing up and out and exposed bare carbon-fibre weave under clear lacquer. Ice blue, gloss white, orange and gunmetal. A ghost-like shield mark. Minimal interiors of carbon, leather and aluminium. Hollow carbon or forged five-spoke shapes keep it technical.'),
    ('Spyker', 'Europe', '2000s', 'cars', 'In the style of Spyker, bold, eccentric, ornate Dutch hand-built luxury that mixes aviation cues with opulence. A circular hub-like centre with spoke-like bars radiating from it, a bulging body with exposed round forms and a compact core. Polished multi-spoke turbine-like patterns. Bright orange, lime green, black, silver and pearl white. Diamond-quilted leather in contrasting colours, exposed turned aluminium and big round white faces. Mechanical jewellery, eccentric and showy.'),
    ('Simca', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Simca, jaunty, post-war and optimistic French pontoon design. A rounded body, a wide-mouth chrome opening, round forms, wraparound glazing, chrome trim strips along the flanks, a rounded end with chrome edges, a swallow mark and pastel two-tone paint. Cream over sea green, pink over grey, turquoise and sand. Bench forms in vinyl and cloth and chrome-ringed dials keep the mood sunny.'),
    ('Hispano-Suiza', 'Europe', '1920s-30s', 'cars', 'In the style of Hispano-Suiza, aristocratic, grand and sculptural luxury of the 1920s and 1930s. A long louvred mass, a tall narrow chrome front and large freestanding round forms. Deep blue, burgundy, black and silver with polished brass or nickel brightwork. Deep buttoned leather. Wire spokes, flowing separate wings and coachbuilt bodies in polished wood or aluminium add craftsmanship, with polished burr walnut and brass-bezelled instruments inside.'),
    ('Bristol', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Bristol, discreet, reserved, hand-built and clubby grand touring with an aircraft-inspired shape. A long mass, a smooth aerodynamic body and a gently curved roof. Dark green, grey, cream, black and claret. Deep leather, polished walnut and clear round faces. Small oval nose with twin kidney-shaped openings, round forms set in the flanks and hidden details behind flaps add quiet eccentricity.'),
]
